Subject: [PATCH 6/6] tests: make tt-blaze's `tests` package importable at all

`from tests.blaze.utils.torch_golden import comp_pcc` can never resolve from a
tt-blaze checkout, no matter the `PYTHONPATH` order.

`tt-blaze/tests/` has no `__init__.py`, so it can only ever contribute a
*namespace portion*. `tt-blaze/tt-metal/tests/` does have one (it is an empty
file, but it exists), and `env.sh` puts both on `sys.path`. Python's finder
scans the path in order, and the first *regular* package it finds terminates the
search and wins outright — namespace portions are only merged among themselves
and never merged with a regular package. So `import tests` binds to
`tt-blaze/tt-metal/tests`, which has no `blaze` subpackage, and
`tests.blaze.anything` raises `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named
'tests.blaze'`. Reordering `sys.path` does not help: putting the namespace
portion first still leaves the regular package to be found and preferred.

Adding the two `__init__.py` files makes `tt-blaze/tests` a regular package too,
at which point path order decides and tt-blaze's own comes first.

CONFIRMED EMPIRICALLY, off-device: reproduced the shadowing with a minimal
directory pair, and verified the two files fix it.

Who this affects: `blaze-vs-ttnn-bench/scripts/ab_harness.py:132` does exactly
this import and is unusable out of the box. We worked around it by registering
the module by file path, which is why our archived benchmark scripts do not use
the documented import. Pytest itself is unaffected — it uses rootdir-relative
collection, not this import path — which is presumably why this has survived.

Contents are an SPDX header and nothing else, matching `tt-metal/tests/__init__.py`
(empty) and the header convention of tt-blaze's other `__init__.py` files.

Independent of patches 1-5 of 6.
---
diff --git a/tests/__init__.py b/tests/__init__.py
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..955944f30
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/__init__.py
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2025 Tenstorrent Inc.
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
diff --git a/tests/blaze/__init__.py b/tests/blaze/__init__.py
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..955944f30
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/blaze/__init__.py
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2025 Tenstorrent Inc.
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
